# agentic-sf environment, for a factory stamped with `--harness claude_code`.
#
# THERE IS NO API KEY TO SET for this harness: the Claude Code CLI brings its
# own auth (`claude auth`). An agent you move to `harness: pi` needs that
# provider's key here, e.g. OPENROUTER_API_KEY.

# Where the agentic-sf skill itself lives. install.py fills this in from the
# path it ran from and leaves whatever is already here alone.
ASF_SKILL=

# Optional overrides
# CLAUDE_PATH=claude               # Claude Code binary if not on PATH
# ENGINEER_NAME=                   # engineer lane label, defaults to git user.name
